{"id": "4204", "title": "南史", "author": "李延寿", "category": "文学名著", "count": 80, "available": 80, "cover": "files/article/image/4/4204/4204s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/4/4204.htm", "intro": "《南史》是合南朝宋、齐、梁、陈四代历史为一编的纪传体史著，记事起自南朝宋武帝刘裕永初元年（公元420年），止于陈后主陈叔宝祯明三年（公元589年），记述南朝四代一百七十年的历史。《南史》与《北史》为姊妹篇，是由李大师及其子李延寿两代人编撰完成的。", "base": "files/article/html/4/4204", "chapters": [{"title": "卷一 宋本纪上第一", "file": "331085.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二 宋本纪中第二", "file": "331118.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷三 宋本纪下第三", "file": "331153.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷四 齐本纪上第四", "file": "331189.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷五 齐本纪下第五", "file": "331227.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷六 梁本纪上第六", "file": "331257.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷七 梁本纪中第七", "file": "331309.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷八 梁本纪下第八", "file": "331342.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷九 陈本纪上第九", "file": "331350.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十 陈本纪下第十", "file": "331351.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十一 列传第一", "file": "331352.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十二 列传第二", "file": "331353.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十三 列传第三", "file": "331356.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十四 列传第四", "file": "331382.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十五 列传第五", "file": "331411.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十六 列传第六", "file": "331437.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十七 列传第七", "file": "331466.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十八 列传第八", "file": "331548.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷十九 列传第九", "file": "331618.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十 列传第十", "file": "331702.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十一 列传第十一", "file": "332243.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十二 列传第十二", "file": "332345.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十三 列传第十三", "file": "332411.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十四 列传第十四", "file": "332476.html", "available": true}, {"title": "卷二十五 列传第十五", "file"